  "prefLabel": "Fire 101.24 Subject matter expert",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fire 101.24 “Subject matter expert” means a person who possesses a specialized expertise in a particular subject area and who has met the requirements of these rules to teach only in that particular area.\n\nSource (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Fire 100) #12225-A, eff 6-28-17",
